<TeXmacs|2.1.5>

<style|article>

<\body>
  <doc-data|<doc-title|OpenType mathematical fonts>>

  The same formulas are set with each of the OpenType fonts of the
  Document<nbsp>\<gtr\> Font<nbsp>\<gtr\> Mathematical font menu which ship
  with TeXmacs: the TeX Gyre fonts Termes, Pagella, Bonum and Schola, and
  STIX, each together with the text font of the same family.

  <section|TeX Gyre Termes>

  <\with|font|termes|math-font|math-termes>
    Big delimiters, extensible arrows, small radicals and wide accents;
    big operators in the text style:
    <math|<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>,
    <math|<big|prod><rsub|p>p<rsup|-s>> and
    <math|<big|int><rsub|0><rsup|\<infty\>>e<rsup|-x>*\<mathd\>x>.

    <\equation*>
      <matrix|<tformat|<table|<row|<cell|<frac|1|2>>|<cell|<frac|a|b+c>>>|<row|<cell|<sqrt|x<rsup|2>+1>>|<cell|<big|sum><rsub|k=0><rsup|n>x<rsub|k>>>>>>,<space|1em><around*|\<langle\>|<frac|<frac|1|2>|<frac|3|4>>|\<rangle\>>,<space|1em><around*|\||<frac|x|y>|\|>,<space|1em><around*|[|<frac|1|1+<frac|1|1+<frac|1|x>>>|]>,<space|1em><around*|{|<frac|a|b>|}>
    </equation*>

    <\equation*>
      A<long-arrow|\<rubber-rightarrow\>|f>B<long-arrow|\<rubber-leftarrow\>|g|h>C<long-arrow|\<rubber-leftrightarrow\>|<text|a
      longer label>>D<long-arrow|\<rubber-Rightarrow\>|n\<rightarrow\>\<infty\>>E,<space|2em><sqrt|x>,<space|1em><sqrt|x<rsup|2>+y<rsup|2>>,<space|1em><sqrt|x+y|3>
    </equation*>

    <\equation*>
      <wide|x|^>,<space|1em><wide|x+y|\<wide-hat\>>,<space|1em><wide|a*b*c*d|\<wide-tilde\>>,<space|1em><wide|f*g|\<wide-bar\>>,<space|1em><wide|x+y|\<wide-check\>>,<space|1em><wide|x+y|\<wide-breve\>>,<space|1em><wide|A*B|\<wide-vect\>>,<space|1em><wide|a+b+c|\<wide-overbrace\>>,<space|1em><wide*|a+b+c|\<wide-underbrace\>>
    </equation*>
  </with>

  <section|TeX Gyre Pagella>

  <\with|font|pagella|math-font|math-pagella>
    Big delimiters, extensible arrows, small radicals and wide accents;
    big operators in the text style:
    <math|<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>,
    <math|<big|prod><rsub|p>p<rsup|-s>> and
    <math|<big|int><rsub|0><rsup|\<infty\>>e<rsup|-x>*\<mathd\>x>.

    <\equation*>
      <matrix|<tformat|<table|<row|<cell|<frac|1|2>>|<cell|<frac|a|b+c>>>|<row|<cell|<sqrt|x<rsup|2>+1>>|<cell|<big|sum><rsub|k=0><rsup|n>x<rsub|k>>>>>>,<space|1em><around*|\<langle\>|<frac|<frac|1|2>|<frac|3|4>>|\<rangle\>>,<space|1em><around*|\||<frac|x|y>|\|>,<space|1em><around*|[|<frac|1|1+<frac|1|1+<frac|1|x>>>|]>,<space|1em><around*|{|<frac|a|b>|}>
    </equation*>

    <\equation*>
      A<long-arrow|\<rubber-rightarrow\>|f>B<long-arrow|\<rubber-leftarrow\>|g|h>C<long-arrow|\<rubber-leftrightarrow\>|<text|a
      longer label>>D<long-arrow|\<rubber-Rightarrow\>|n\<rightarrow\>\<infty\>>E,<space|2em><sqrt|x>,<space|1em><sqrt|x<rsup|2>+y<rsup|2>>,<space|1em><sqrt|x+y|3>
    </equation*>

    <\equation*>
      <wide|x|^>,<space|1em><wide|x+y|\<wide-hat\>>,<space|1em><wide|a*b*c*d|\<wide-tilde\>>,<space|1em><wide|f*g|\<wide-bar\>>,<space|1em><wide|x+y|\<wide-check\>>,<space|1em><wide|x+y|\<wide-breve\>>,<space|1em><wide|A*B|\<wide-vect\>>,<space|1em><wide|a+b+c|\<wide-overbrace\>>,<space|1em><wide*|a+b+c|\<wide-underbrace\>>
    </equation*>
  </with>

  <section|TeX Gyre Bonum>

